                         own text as one toggled group (display:contents — see
                         styles.css), not one shared icon for both, so a touch visitor
                         never sees a mouse-pointer glyph next to "Tap it...". Same hint as
                         weddings.html's showcase calendar (see its own comment there). */}
                    <div class="availability-note">
